      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92ae252b9e55e5acec552d53",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尾巴的旧伤……因为冲动（pathos）而隐隐\\n作疼！吹响决战的号角（Gjallarhorn）吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a8513acd9e01493bf93ca21516140be447445e33f480ee158731b14579bc38b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7499dcdf39274fd98f245e37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将诗（Psyche）写入黑之书……感兴趣吗？\\n但是只有身为胜者的我才能够阅读！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f27449a4b5b4754eac916bfdee17ba00c043f6f054c673207db68fd43f4e594",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbd973e561b72c26ec1e2bee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是说啊！身体已经快按捺不住了！\\n欸，可以让我去他们面前跑一跑吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cc1e151a6b877537c08acf6b34744810face329a8d56a266e1e9304676e2ae0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41463470e013affdb9252935",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要一起吃吗？刚刚现采的喔！\\n这可是会让人充满干劲的美味啊～！",
